  message: "PR #2200, 2026-11-16 (WI-fuvit): Solidity structs, enums and enum values are symbols now and Struct(...) / Enum(x) calls bind them. Still open here or beside it: error declarations and user-defined value types are not symbols; member access emits no edge to a field."  # 84f1
